      "message": "Headers like \"Description:\" and \"Motivation:\" aren\u0027t particularly helpful - the entire commit message body is ~15 lines. They may be helpful in multi-page documents to provide entry-points into the content, but that\u0027s not a problem that needs solving here. Can you please remove them?",
